"Anything else she builds: tools, scripts, whole programs — drafted by her minds, held here, yours to take anywhere. JavaScript runs on the spot." = "Qualsiasi altra cosa costruisca: strumenti, script, interi programmi — redatti dalle sue menti, conservati qui, tuoi da sparare.";
