"Costumes dress this device in generic shapes; its own addresses stay its own. Nothing here copies a real device's identity, clones an advertisement the ear has heard, or plants a fake tracker — a wardrobe, not a forgery kit." = "I costumi vestono questo dispositivo con forme generiche; i suoi indirizzi restano suoi. Niente qui copia un dispositivo reale.";
